{"id": "EUVD-2026-86901", "enisaUuid": "5b1897ce-f1c0-34ba-8715-4a4a120ffcaa", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\niommu/s390: Fix NULL dereference in iova_to_phys() with ZPCI_TABLE_TYPE_RFX\n\nWhen using a 5-level translation table via ZPCI_TABLE_TYPE_RFX\nget_rso_from_iova() returns NULL when the region-first entry is invalid.\nYet in get_rto_from_iova() the region-second origin rso is not checked\nto be non-NULL before accessing rso[rsx] leading to a NULL pointer\ndereference instead of a NULL return when iova_to_phys() is called on\na unmapped IOVA. Fix this by adding the missing NULL check.", "datePublished": "2026-09-25T10:22:09", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:09:57", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d0502ed0a1aae97e2ab7a21545903ba612d9f02e", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/41b5e0ce6801bf04d8fd3bca46e8c393349ebd5c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/20db6573301e66cd65ebf6c130b6563c69374d9d"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-97593", "GHSA-grwc-9m6f-f7hf"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "06d85cef-02f7-3fc6-987a-a6460c1949cd", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.53"}, {"id": "170e16b2-36d4-3a8f-8a27-61b15752080c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "81244074b518aeb90de5f68e7e825564c29c5c50 <20db6573301e66cd65ebf6c130b6563c69374d9d"}, {"id": "41250711-669e-3b8c-bfe9-a6c7fee854fb", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.7"}, {"id": "4168330b-8d1f-3a21-a3e2-78f84ecf9d0f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "5a3dad71-7566-3d7d-920e-2df31bcd1e07", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "81244074b518aeb90de5f68e7e825564c29c5c50 <d0502ed0a1aae97e2ab7a21545903ba612d9f02e"}, {"id": "6292545b-6105-3d9a-a69d-0303881035c0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "81244074b518aeb90de5f68e7e825564c29c5c50 <41b5e0ce6801bf04d8fd3bca46e8c393349ebd5c"}, {"id": "bdd3312c-c6c1-3fc6-91cc-e51c8154aefa", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "c56c7493-90a8-3715-a40c-e7df82315e56", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.16"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "66ac8ac5-232c-30bf-8617-1bf145009404", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}